# Statically linked Go binary: no shared-library dependencies.
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
Description: eBPF-based high-performance transparent proxy
 dae ("Great") is a transparent proxy for Linux that steers traffic in the
 kernel with eBPF: direct traffic bypasses the userspace proxy entirely,
 and split routing works per process, domain, IP and MAC address. It speaks
 Shadowsocks, VMess, VLESS (Reality), Trojan, Tuic, Juicity, Hysteria2,
 HTTP(S), SOCKS5 and NaïveProxy, with proxy subscriptions and DNS routing.
 .
 This package installs the official upstream release binary unmodified,
 together with the bundled v2fly geoip/geosite databases. It needs a
 kernel with BTF and eBPF support (5.17 or newer).
